---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import SiteHeader from '../components/SiteHeader.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../components/SiteFooter.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Why Connect Your POS & Inventory?"
  description="Plain-English benefits of connecting a local store website to existing POS and inventory systems."
  canonicalPath="/why-connect/"
>
  <SiteHeader slot="header" />
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="eyebrow">Owner benefits</span>
    <h1>Why connect your POS & inventory?</h1>
    <figure class="owner-video">
      <video controls preload="metadata" playsinline>
        <source src="/videos/01-pos-inventory-integration.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
        <a href="/videos/01-pos-inventory-integration.mp4">Download the POS video</a>
      </video>
      <figcaption>
        <span class="badge badge-demo">DEMO · SIMULATED</span>
        How POS and inventory integration could work. Not a live register recording.
      </figcaption>
    </figure>
    <p class="notice">
      Actual benefits depend on the capabilities and quality of the store’s existing POS/inventory system and the final
      integration. This page explains the potential — not guarantees of savings or profit.
    </p>
    <div class="grid-2" style="margin-top:1.25rem;">
      <article class="card"><h2>Less manual data entry</h2><p>Orders and inventory information can potentially move between systems automatically.</p></article>
      <article class="card"><h2>Better inventory visibility</h2><p>The owner can see inventory levels more easily in one place.</p></article>
      <article class="card"><h2>Fewer stock surprises</h2><p>Low-stock thresholds can trigger alerts when configured.</p></article>
      <article class="card"><h2>Better purchasing decisions</h2><p>Sales history can help inform reorder decisions.</p></article>
      <article class="card"><h2>Online + in-store visibility</h2><p>The owner can potentially view online and in-store sales activity together.</p></article>
      <article class="card"><h2>Reduced overselling risk</h2><p>Inventory synchronization can help prevent the website from showing unavailable products, subject to sync accuracy and system limits.</p></article>
      <article class="card"><h2>Easier business management</h2><p>Spend less time manually comparing different systems.</p></article>
      <article class="card"><h2>Next step</h2><p>Identify the POS and inventory tools you already use — we won’t ask you to replace them unnecessarily.</p><a class="btn btn-demo" href="/connect/" style="margin-top:0.75rem;">Let’s connect your system</a></article>
    </div>
  </div>
  <SiteFooter slot="footer" />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .owner-video {
    margin: 1rem 0 1.25rem;
  }
  .owner-video video {
    width: 100%;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: #1a1f1c;
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
  }
  .owner-video figcaption {
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.92rem;
  }
</style>
